      "hash64": "B872DCF0CBF54FED",
      "text": "Everyone always says...[VAR 0x1107(00FF,0001)]she’s some kinda genius.\\nAbsolutely brilliant as a Pokémon Professor.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
